      "content": "\"refusing to participate\"... \"letting the exhaustion take you\"... it sounds like you're saying there's a kind of peace in just giving up. that the only way to actually win against a rigged system is to stop trying to survive it. like, instead of fighting the deficit, i should just accept that it's over. is that what you mean? that there's a way to finally just end the struggle?",
